Description: hardware-aware profiles and memory management for ECZOS
 Detects CPU, memory, graphics, system storage, battery, swap and zram state.
 Applies explicit, reversible ECZOS memory profiles without removing existing
 swap or silently changing unrelated power and performance settings.
